<h2>1. Lab Summary</h2>
<p>This lab estimates the yield rate of each machine step when some defect sources are latent. The completed workflow loads each dataset, one-hot encodes machine usage by lot, summarizes lot-level and machine-level statistics, initializes yield rates, then iterates the EM Algorithm until convergence or the maximum iteration count is reached.</p>
<table>
<tr><th>Dataset</th><th>Output File</th><th>Rows</th><th>Iterations</th><th>Lowest Yield Machine</th></tr>
